{
 "brief": "Dimitri Diliani, spokesman for the Democratic Reform movement within Fatah, told Shehab Wire that postponing Palestinian legislative elections to September 11, 2027—to coincide with presidential elections—reveals a deeper crisis in Palestinian governance. Diliani characterized the delay as evidence that President Abbas is blocking elections out of fear of losing authority.\n\nThe spokesman argued that the postponement amounts to confiscating Palestinians' right to choose their leadership. The legislative elections were previously scheduled for an earlier date before being rescheduled.",
